Manage dependencies

Usage: pooka deps <command>

Manage dependencies.

Commands:
  download  Resolve and download dependencies using existing pins
  update    Re-resolve dependencies and update pooka.lock
  list      List locked packages without fetching
  tree      Show locked dependency edges without fetching

Run pooka deps <command> --help for individual help.

Options:
  -h, --help  Print this help

